0. First, the mental model (MOST IMPORTANT)

This is not UI-first design.
It is atmosphere-first design.

The reference app does not start by placing UI components.
It starts by establishing a mood, then quietly lets UI sit on top.

Your site should feel like:
	•	walking into a dark room
	•	light leaking through glass
	•	objects floating in space, not aligned to grids

If the page feels “designed” at first glance, it’s wrong.
